++### Entity Structure (Key Rules Only)
++
++- URL: plural=list, `/admin/`+plural=CRUD, singular+slug=detail
++- Schema: `entityType`/`entityId` (not `type`/`typeId`)
++- latestUpdates type: `'business'`, `'non_profit'`, `'public_sector'` (singular, not plural)
++
++### Local Development
++
++**Build (Windows)**: `pnpm exec -- astro build` — `package.json` uses `cross-env CI=true` for Windows compatibility.
++
++**Dev server**: `pnpm exec -- wrangler dev --local --port 8787` — uses local D1, KV, R2.
++
++**Run E2E tests**: `pnpm exec -- playwright test e2e/homepage.spec.ts --project=chromium --reporter=list`
++
++**SSR pages require remote D1**: `wrangler.jsonc` has `"remote": true` so `wrangler dev` (without `--local`) uses Cloudflare remote D1. The `--local` flag overrides this to use local D1.
